<title>USA: CardioDynamics names Stephen Loomis CFO.</title>
<headline>CardioDynamics names Stephen Loomis CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>CardioDynamics International Corp said Friday it appointed Steve Loomis, currently vice president, finance, to the additional post of chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Loomis, 37, joined the company in September 1996.</p>
<p>The company said its former CFO was Stephenson Dechant, who stepped down when Loomis was appinted but remains a director of CardioDynamics.</p>
